  "compiled_truth": "⚗️ Top ChatGPT Tools to Explore in December 2022\n            \n            \n            \n            \n        \n\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n        \n        \n        \n        \n        \n        \n        \n        \n\n        \n            \n                \n            \n                \n            \n                \n            \n                \n            \n                \n            \n                \n            \n                \n            \n                \n            \n                \n            \n                \n            \n                \n            \n                \n            \n                \n            \n                \n            \n                \n            \n                \n            \n                \n            \n                \n            \n                \n            \n                \n            \n                \n            \n                \n            \n        \n\n        \n        \n        \n        \n        \n        \n        \n        \n        \n        \n        \n\n        \n\n        \n            \n        \n\n        \n\n        \n            \n                \n            \n        \n            \n                \n            \n        \n            \n                \n            \n        \n            \n                \n            \n        \n            \n                \n            \n        \n            \n                \n            \n        \n            \n                \n            \n        \n            \n                \n            \n        \n            \n                \n            \n        \n            \n                \n            \n        \n            \n                \n            \n        \n            \n                \n            \n        \n            \n                \n            \n        \n            \n                \n            \n        \n            \n                \n            \n        \n            \n        \n            \n        \n            \n        \n\n        \n\n        \n            \n        \n\n        \n        \n          \n        \n        \n        \n\n        \n\n        \n            \n        \n            \n        \n\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n            \n        \n    \n\n    \n        \n\n        \n            \n        \n\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n            AI Supremacy \n\nSubscribeSign in⚗️ Top ChatGPT Tools to Explore in December 2022\n\nA growing list \n\nMichael SpencerDec 10, 2022∙ Paid9ShareHey Everyone, \n\nSince everyone is still talking about chatGPT, to some degree I’m still exploring the realm. It’s not as advanced as many of us are giving credit to it and it has really important caveats and A.I. alignment limitations. \n\nThat being said, uncovering the Twitter threads about ChatGPT is pretty fun, see here and here. While ChatGPT is just a limited demo, 1 million users in five days isn’t so bad if this were a real product or if it was actually ready to launch. If it were safe, accurate and A.I. alignment proofed. Which it is not. \n\n#ChatGPT</span> \\n\\n\\\"But here's the catch - ChatGPT's responses only touch reality at a tangent. While they may sound convincing, they are ultimately fictional creations of the GAN.\\\" - <span class=\\\"tweet-fake-link\\\">@quaesita</span> Google's Cassie Kozyrkov\\n\\n<span class=\\\"tweet-fake-link\\\">#AI</span> <span class=\\\"tweet-fake-link\\\">#OpenAI</span> \\n\\n\",\"username\":\"AISupremacyNews\",\"name\":\"AI Supremacy\",\"profile_image_url\":\"\",\"date\":\"Thu Dec 08 07:16:18 +0000 2022\",\"photos\":[],\"quoted_tweet\":{},\"reply_count\":0,\"retweet_count\":0,\"like_count\":0,\"impression_count\":0,\"expanded_url\":{\"url\":\"https://kozyrkov.medium.com/introducing-chatgpt-aa824ad89623\",\"image\":\"https://bucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/f6823d4f-36a2-44ce-bc2e-7c9ef42d0ca2_1200x750.gif\",\"title\":\"Introducing ChatGPT!\",\"description\":\"The Revolutionary New Tool for Conversation Generation\",\"domain\":\"kozyrkov.medium.com\"},\"video_url\":null,\"belowTheFold\":false}\" class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-flexDirection-column pc-gap-12 pc-padding-16 pc-reset bg-primary-zk6FDl outline-detail-vcQLyr pc-borderRadius-md sizing-border-box-DggLA4 pressable-lg-kV7yq8 font-text-qe4AeH tweet-fWkQfo twitter-embed\">AI Supremacy@AISupremacyNewsA quote I like very much on #ChatGPT \n\n\"But here's the catch - ChatGPT's responses only touch reality at a tangent. While they may sound convincing, they are ultimately fictional creations of the GAN.\" - @quaesita Google's Cassie Kozyrkov\n\n#AI #OpenAI \n\nkozyrkov.medium.comIntroducing ChatGPT!7:16 AM · Dec 8, 2022The internet and hype bots (most of us) for the most part don’t care about A.I. ethics. Which is unfortunate and reacting in the way our online behavior has been shaped after decades of digital advertisings' shady dominance. Can’t fault the user if they are the product right?\n\nBecause it isn’t tied to the constraints of reality, ChatGPT can engage in completely imaginary conversations and provide creative, out-of-the-box responses. - Casey Kozyrkov (108k followers on Medium) \n\nThus ChatGPT since it isn’t real, has gone viral more with the help of misinformation coached in hype. But let’s talk about actual utility and tools for sec today. \n\n🔥 The Revolutionary New Tool for Conversation and Text Generation\n\n1. ChatGPT for Google Chrome Extension \n\n(link)\n\n 2. A browser extension that augments your ChatGPT prompts with web results. \n\n(link)\n\n3. ChatGPT for Mac, living in your menubar. \n\n(link)\n\n4. 🔎 Neeva. evolutionising search with LLMs and an ad-free, privacy-first model. (not directly ChatGPT related) \n\n(link)\n\nLet’s continue with the 16 others that popped up in the last few days. \n\nContinue reading this post for free, courtesy of Michael Spencer.\n\nClaim my free postOr purchase a paid subscription.PreviousNext© 2026 Michael Spencer · Privacy ∙ Terms ∙ Collection notice Start your SubstackGet the appSubstack is the home for great culture\n        \n\n        \n            \n            \n        \n\n        \n        \n        \n        \n        \n        \n        \n\n        \n        \n            \n                \n            \n                \n            \n                \n            \n                \n            \n                \n            \n                \n            \n                \n            \n                \n            \n                \n            \n                \n            \n                \n            \n                \n            \n                \n            \n                \n            \n                \n            \n                \n            \n                \n            \n                \n            \n                \n            \n                \n            \n                \n            \n                \n            \n                \n            \n                \n            \n                \n            \n                \n            \n                \n            \n                \n            \n                \n            \n                \n            \n                \n            \n                \n            \n                \n            \n                \n            \n                \n            \n                \n            \n                \n            \n                \n            \n                \n            \n                \n            \n                \n            \n                \n            \n                \n            \n                \n            \n                \n            \n                \n            \n                \n            \n                \n            \n                \n            \n                \n            \n                \n           